pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.86<br/>April 23, 2013</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Ice Witch Temple</b> is a cave located below the western peninsula in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarian%20Settlements\">Barbarian Settlements</a> area, southwest of <a href=\"#/wiki/Bittermor\">Bittermor</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31923,31360,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31923, 31360, 7)</a>). It is inhabited by several <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Witch\">Ice Witches</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Golem\">Ice Golems</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spiders</a>. Under the temple itself, there are pits containing <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon%20Hatchling\">Frost Dragon Hatchlings</a>, which can be accessed by <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">levitating</a>.\n</p><p>For the first level it is enough to be lvl ~70.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Floor (caves)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Golem\"><img alt=\"Ice Golem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_Golem_6e20e0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></sp